[{"id":1778551801524,"text":"你红着眼眶，摇了摇头。","rawContent":"你红着眼眶，摇了摇头。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:19","timestamp":1778552370787,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7819},{"id":1778551801525,"text":"“乖。”他奖励般地亲了亲你的额头，然后扶着你的腰，开始缓缓地动起来。","rawContent":"“乖。”他奖励般地亲了亲你的额头，然后扶着你的腰，开始缓缓地动起来。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:19","timestamp":1778552375315,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7820},{"id":1778551801526,"text":"这个姿//势让你能清晰地感觉到，他是如何在你体//内进//出、研//磨。每一次抬起，每一次坐下，都伴随着一阵灭顶的快//感。","rawContent":"这个姿//势让你能清晰地感觉到，他是如何在你体//内进//出、研//磨。每一次抬起，每一次坐下，都伴随着一阵灭顶的快//感。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:19","timestamp":1778552379856,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7821},{"id":1778551801527,"text":"“看着我。”他的声音带着蛊惑，“告诉我，周衍碰过你吗？像我这样。”","rawContent":"“看着我。”他的声音带着蛊惑，“告诉我，周衍碰过你吗？像我这样。”","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:19","timestamp":1778552384375,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7822},{"id":1778551801528,"text":"“没有……”你闭着眼睛，不想回答这种问题。","rawContent":"“没有……”你闭着眼睛，不想回答这种问题。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:19","timestamp":1778552388908,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7823},{"id":1778551801529,"text":"“睁开眼！”他的语气骤然变冷。","rawContent":"“睁开眼！”他的语气骤然变冷。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:19","timestamp":1778552392174,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7824},{"id":1778551801530,"text":"你吓得一个激灵，连忙睁开眼。","rawContent":"你吓得一个激灵，连忙睁开眼。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:19","timestamp":1778552395686,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7825},{"id":1778551801531,"text":"“他碰过你哪里？”他像一个最严苛的审讯官，不放过任何一个细节，“手？还是腰？”","rawContent":"“他碰过你哪里？”他像一个最严苛的审讯官，不放过任何一个细节，“手？还是腰？”","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:20","timestamp":1778552400215,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7826},{"id":1778551801532,"text":"“……手。”你艰难地吐出两个字。","rawContent":"“……手。”你艰难地吐出两个字。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:20","timestamp":1778552403904,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7827},{"id":1778551801533,"text":"“只是牵手？”","rawContent":"“只是牵手？”","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:20","timestamp":1778552406365,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7828},{"id":1778551801534,"text":"“……嗯。”","rawContent":"“……嗯。”","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:20","timestamp":1778552408255,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7829},{"id":1778551801535,"text":"“撒谎。”他的动作猛地加重，撞得你眼前发黑，“你们谈了三个月，只是牵手？”","rawContent":"“撒谎。”他的动作猛地加重，撞得你眼前发黑，“你们谈了三个月，只是牵手？”","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:20","timestamp":1778552412784,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7830},{"id":1778551801536,"text":"“就……就亲过……”你被他逼得没办法，只能断断续续地交代。","rawContent":"“就……就亲过……”你被他逼得没办法，只能断断续续地交代。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:20","timestamp":1778552417314,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7831},{"id":1778551801537,"text":"“亲过哪里？嘴吗？”他的每一次发问，都伴随着一次凶//狠的顶//弄。","rawContent":"“亲过哪里？嘴吗？”他的每一次发问，都伴随着一次凶//狠的顶//弄。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:20","timestamp":1778552421853,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7832},{"id":1778551801538,"text":"“……嗯。”","rawContent":"“……嗯。”","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:20","timestamp":1778552424034,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7833},{"id":1778551801539,"text":"“喜欢吗？他的吻。”","rawContent":"“喜欢吗？他的吻。”","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:20","timestamp":1778552426375,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7834},{"id":1778551801540,"text":"你没有回答，只是哭着摇头。","rawContent":"你没有回答，只是哭着摇头。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:20","timestamp":1778552429974,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7835},{"id":1778551801541,"text":"“说话！”","rawContent":"“说话！”","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:20","timestamp":1778552431804,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7836},{"id":1778551801542,"text":"“……不喜欢……”","rawContent":"“……不喜欢……”","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:20","timestamp":1778552434624,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7837},{"id":1778551801543,"text":"“那喜欢谁的？”","rawContent":"“那喜欢谁的？”","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:20","timestamp":1778552436964,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7838},{"id":1778551801544,"text":"“……你的……”","rawContent":"“……你的……”","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:20","timestamp":1778552439576,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7839},{"id":1778551801545,"text":"“喜欢我什么？”他似乎并不满足于这个答案，继续追问，“喜欢我像现在这样//干//你，还是喜欢我平时哄着你？”","rawContent":"“喜欢我什么？”他似乎并不满足于这个答案，继续追问，“喜欢我像现在这样//干//你，还是喜欢我平时哄着你？”","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:20","timestamp":1778552444112,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7840},{"id":17785518015