":"地毯上的硝烟还未散尽，你又被他抱了起来。","rawContent":"地毯上的硝烟还未散尽，你又被他抱了起来。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:21","timestamp":1778552468224,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7846},{"id":1778551801552,"text":"你的腿软得像面条，只能像一只树袋熊一样，无力地挂在他的身上。","rawContent":"你的腿软得像面条，只能像一只树袋熊一样，无力地挂在他的身上。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:21","timestamp":1778552472754,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7847},{"id":1778551801553,"text":"他抱着你，走出了客厅，推开了阳台的落地玻璃门。","rawContent":"他抱着你，走出了客厅，推开了阳台的落地玻璃门。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:21","timestamp":1778552477284,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7848},{"id":1778551801554,"text":"初夏的晚风带着一丝凉意，吹在你汗湿的身体上，让你忍不住打了个哆嗦。你下意识地往他怀里缩了缩。","rawContent":"初夏的晚风带着一丝凉意，吹在你汗湿的身体上，让你忍不住打了个哆嗦。你下意识地往他怀里缩了缩。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:21","timestamp":1778552481814,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7849},{"id":1778551801555,"text":"“第三个，阳台。”","rawContent":"“第三个，阳台。”","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:21","timestamp":1778552484125,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7850},{"id":1778551801556,"text":"他的声音在你头顶响起，平静得没有一丝波澜。","rawContent":"他的声音在你头顶响起，平静得没有一丝波澜。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:21","timestamp":17785524